    "summary_one_sentence": "Framed for his billionaire boss's murder, Cole Reed infiltrates a cargo ship to track down the killers and uncovers a massive international conspiracy.",
    "summary_short": "After witnessing the brutal murder of his billionaire employer, Cole Reed finds himself framed as the primary suspect. Determined to clear his name and exact revenge, he boards a cargo ship carrying those responsible. As he navigates the high-seas confrontation, Cole discovers that his boss's death is merely one piece of a deadly global conspiracy.",
    "summary_long": "Cole Reed's life is turned upside down when his high-profile billionaire boss is assassinated right before his eyes. Before he can process the tragedy, corrupt forces frame Cole for the murder, forcing him on the run from international law enforcement. Driven by loyalty and a desire for justice, Cole tracks the perpetrators to a secluded cargo ship embarking on a long voyage. Infiltrating the vessel alone, he wages a stealthy, one-man war against a ruthless crew of mercenaries. As Cole fights his way through the ship's claustrophobic corridors, he uncovers encrypted files detailing a vast geopolitical plot. The assassination was not a personal vendetta, but a calculated move to trigger a global crisis for corporate gain. With time running out, Cole must defeat the mercenaries on board and broadcast the truth before the ship reaches its destination. Outnumbered and outgunned, his dangerous crusade becomes a fight not just for personal vengeance, but to prevent catastrophic worldwide fallout.",
